Aim: To capture and analyze network packets using Wireshark.                                                                                                                   
                                                                                        
What is Wireshark?
Wireshark is a network protocol analyzer.
In simple words, it helps us see the data packets travelling through a network.

Procedure :
Open Wireshark.
Select your active Wi-Fi or Ethernet interface.
Click Start Capture.
Open a website in your browser to generate network traffic.
Observe the captured packets.
Apply a display filter.
Stop the capture.
